              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’atu m’umaru won kadi min ma sagu an eromo kuda ngo; ng’atu m’umaru wode kadi nyare de ma sagu an eromo kuda ngo. ",
